 chat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the station’s mysteries together as you manage its tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/a4e123ad8c01d4cfaaf82d74be4d45f4.poster.avif?t=1764626368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/a4e123ad8c01d4cfaaf82d74be4d45f4.webm?t=1764626368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/ba03146f008fecdc4e9a7b38eebd8e75.avif?t=1764626368\" width=650 height=123 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in rural Japan, the station and its surroundings are brought to life with a cozy, hand crafted aesthetic. The mix of detailed visuals, warm lighting, and thoughtful design creates a gentle but immersive atmosphere. Countryside charm and  visuals, Train Station Simulator: Together in Japan blends comfort with discovery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/771bc28b042b618b1750f46cb4eb518e.poster.avif?t=1764626368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/771bc28b042b618b1750f46cb4eb518e.webm?t=1764626368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963230/extras/ca9bc9e77054e5018b602d962e2aa1a3.avif?t=1764626368\" width=650 height=123 /></span></h2><ul class=